The ESP32-CAM acts as the dedicated vision node. It captures high-framerate wireless video of the driver’s face and streams it over a local network to a Python/OpenCV script, offloading heavy machine learning tasks from the main microcontroller.

\subsection{MAX30102 Biometric Sensor}
\begin{figure}[htbp]
