\label{fig:max30102}
\end{figure}
This medical-grade optical sensor tracks the driver’s Beats Per Minute (BPM) and peripheral oxygen saturation (SpO2). It uses infrared and red LEDs to measure blood flow, feeding live health data to the OLED and the SOS SMS payload.

\subsection{SIM900A GSM Module}
