\label{fig:sim900a}
\end{figure}
The SIM900A enables reliable cellular communication. During an SOS event, it transmits the GPS coordinates, Zone name, and health vitals to predefined contacts. A 3-minute software cooldown logic is applied to prevent cellular spamming.

\subsection{NEO-6M GPS Module}
\begin{figure}[htbp]
