\caption{NEO-6M GPS Module}
\label{fig:gps}
\end{figure}
The NEO-6M module provides real-time, offline satellite geographic location. It supplies highly accurate Latitude and Longitude data formulated into a clickable Google Maps link for emergency responders.

\subsection{DC Vibration Motor \& Buzzer}
\begin{figure}[htbp]
\centerline{\includegraphics[width=0.4\linewidth]{shaftless-vibration-motor.png} \quad \includegraphics[width=0.4\linewidth]{active-buzzer-module-robotics-bangladesh.png}}
\caption{DC Vibration Motor \& Active Buzzer}
\label{fig:motor_buzzer}
\end{figure}
The vibration motor serves as a haptic feedback mechanism to physically wake the driver. It is driven by a 2N2222 NPN transistor acting as a switch and is powered by an isolated 5V Sony Li-ion battery pack to prevent voltage drops on the main ESP32 board.

